  "summary": "<p>A coordinated campaign is underway to sanitize, normalize, and romanticize one of history’s most dangerous and lethal ideologies. Newsweek is currently running a “little red test” that asks about oat milk, shorter workweeks, and tote bags — then scores readers on how ready they are for an “American socialist revolution.” There’s nothing lighthearted about the [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/its-not-a-socialist-revolution-its-misery-starvation-and-death/\">It’s Not a “Socialist Revolution.” It’s Misery, Starvation, and Death.</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
